use award

award incumbent:{Bid} challenger:{Bid} > &{Bid}i
pair (winner incumbent challenger) (get price incumbent)

example lower_price award
{"inputs":{"incumbent":{"name":"B","price":12},"challenger":{"name":"A","price":8}},"expect":[{"name":"A","price":8},12]}

example equal_price award
{"inputs":{"incumbent":{"name":"B","price":12},"challenger":{"name":"A","price":12}},"expect":[{"name":"B","price":12},12]}
